[node name="DebugLabel" type="Label" parent="UI"]
offset_left = 10.0
offset_top = 10.0
offset_right = 450.0
offset_bottom = 200.0
text = "XTREME PLATFORMER TEST LEVEL

Controls:
  WASD / Arrows - Move
  Space - Jump / Double Jump / Homing Attack
  Ctrl (idle) - Spin Dash (hold to charge, release to dash)
  Ctrl (moving) - Roll Attack
  Ctrl (air) - Butt Bounce
  Rails - Jump into rail to grind, hold Ctrl to crouch accelerate
  Auto Paths - Touch entry marker to ride, auto-jumps at end
  Swim - WASD steer, Space ascends, Ctrl descends

Yellow ball shows which way player is facing."

